the site has almost the entire filmography of mankind, but this story remains the best. yes, the story is good, as is the setting of the film. but is this the best thing that the world has created in more than a century of work? is that what worries people? the most pressing? deeper than 'forrest gump'? more classic than the tacitly declared must see 'titanic'?
